# Viewer policy

## Do NOT auto-open PyBullet
- **Never** start `step_drive_pybullet.py` (or other PyBullet GUIs) after every user message.
- Only open PyBullet when the user **explicitly asks**, or when actively debugging that sim.

## FreeCAD
- Follow `freecad-restart.mdc`: after **every** FreeCAD/CAD edit in a turn, kill FreeCAD and reopen `show_jgb37_gui.py` before ending — no exceptions unless the user says not to.

## Blender
- Follow `blender-restart.mdc` only when that turn rebuilds a `.blend`.
